    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "In a world where chickens have had enough of being served up on platters, one fearless fowl rises to lead the resistance against the fast-food giant known as FCK. Welcome to &quot;Chicken Strike\u00ae: Cluck Ops\u2122&quot;, the action-packed adventure where feathers fly and the claws come out!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake control of a courageous chicken armed to the beak with an arsenal of weapons, from egg launchers to poultry-powered rockets. Embark on an epic quest through a variety of vibrant environments, from bustling city streets to the heart of the FCK empire. Prepare for intense battles against waves of crispy adversaries, including Major Fanders.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJoin the resistance, cluck up your courage, and embark on an egg-citing adventure to save chicken-kind from the clutches of the fast-food industry. It's time to show FCK who is the boss!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeather-Fueled Combat: Wield an arsenal of egg-splosive weapons and unleash chaos upon your fast-food foes.<br />\r\nDynamic Environments: Explore diverse landscapes, from bustling city streets to top-secret FCK facilities.<br />\r\nPoultry Power-Ups: Discover special abilities to enhance your chicken's combat prowess.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready to lead the ultimate chicken uprising? The time to strike is now!",
    "about_the_game": "In a world where chickens have had enough of being served up on platters, one fearless fowl rises to lead the resistance against the fast-food giant known as FCK. Welcome to &quot;Chicken Strike\u00ae: Cluck Ops\u2122&quot;, the action-packed adventure where feathers fly and the claws come out!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake control of a courageous chicken armed to the beak with an arsenal of weapons, from egg launchers to poultry-powered rockets. Embark on an epic quest through a variety of vibrant environments, from bustling city streets to the heart of the FCK empire. Prepare for intense battles against waves of crispy adversaries, including Major Fanders.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJoin the resistance, cluck up your courage, and embark on an egg-citing adventure to save chicken-kind from the clutches of the fast-food industry. It's time to show FCK who is the boss!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeather-Fueled Combat: Wield an arsenal of egg-splosive weapons and unleash chaos upon your fast-food foes.<br />\r\nDynamic Environments: Explore diverse landscapes, from bustling city streets to top-secret FCK facilities.<br />\r\nPoultry Power-Ups: Discover special abilities to enhance your chicken's combat prowess.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready to lead the ultimate chicken uprising? The time to strike is now!",
